{"parse": {"title": "GLN-05", "pageid": 6146, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/GLN-04\" title=\"GLN-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">GLN-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/GLN-06\" title=\"GLN-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">GLN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.98.B6.E5.90.BC.E6.98.8E.E6.98.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"嘶吼明星\">嘶吼明星</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 嘶吼明星</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Roaring Stars</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>佳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>张<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>带<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>眩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>带<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>闪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>闪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>明<span class=\"color-value\"></span>星<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1210104</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>它逃走了，带着我的……重要的藏品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不行，追不上了。它推倒的树堵死了路口，我们一时半会儿很难过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那绝对不是普通的魔精，牙仙女士，您看到的魔精活动痕迹是什么样的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>大多数来自中小型魔精，庞大的抓痕明晰但稀少，体型如此巨大的魔精大概率仅此一只。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>在此之外，我们得给那位小姐一个解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线落向混乱的源头，他似乎有所察觉，疑惑地回过头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>你……你们都在看着我？是我的脸还是衣服出了什么问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙侧过头，浑身血浆的年轻人们围成了一个小圈，其中不断传出悲鸣声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>摄影机……我的摄影机，天啊……胶卷也全都毁了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>别太难过了……珍妮弗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>或许我能尝试把它拼起来，变回原来的样子，这样会让你好受点儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>没有用的，里面的东西都没了，所有记录都没了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>是啊，别太难过了。我们能免于人员伤亡可多亏了你的慷慨奉献。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金蜜儿愤怒地抬起头，手中因为爆炸而卷曲的摄影机碎片掉回地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-306001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你说……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>我在试图安慰你的心情。别看我，实际上我也觉得没必要，是那些人推我过来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年低下头，压低声音，向后偏偏脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>你看见了吗？就后面那些，戴帽子的姑娘和穿白衣裳的姑娘……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>没必要？你觉得没必要？你知道你毁了什么吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娇滴滴的金发姑娘气得发抖，天色如她的脸色一般阴云密布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>尖锐的美甲像是一柄尖刀，不断迫近恐怖通的鼻尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>看看这些碎片，书呆子，你以为它们是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>好吧，别激动，让我们理性一点聊聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>如果你是为了你的电影生气，我真的很抱歉。但当时我认为，我们所有人的安全更重要，所以我那么做了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>而且我有个好消息要告诉你。这款记录者更多针对家庭录像研发，拍摄画面效果远不能称之为电影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>从某种意义上来说，我成功地阻止了你拍摄一部奇差无比的烂作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">恐怖通：</div><div>如果你需要财务赔偿的话，请找后面那位戴帽子的小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你说谁会拍烂——呃，不，不是！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>电影！不，我才不是因为电影生气，我一点都不在乎那种蠢东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你以为钱就能解决这件事吗？别想了，那是记录者和Lugus的限量联名款，全球限量三台！只有三台！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>它比珠宝和任何名牌包都更有收藏价值！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>上头镶边的麂皮就够把你的脑袋买下来二百次了，呆瓜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>该死，我的妆！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你们还傻站着干什么，弄走那块儿木头。我们得立刻回小屋去！我可不想感冒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一道身影来到了她身侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你们不适合待在这里。你们应当尽快返回附近的小镇，前往旅馆，好好地洗上一个澡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>我和我的学生会护送你们到达森林边际的公路上，为你们安排可用的车子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>如果你们之中有任何人出现喉咙发痒、体温升高的症状，请到最近的药店购买惠霏芬类药物服用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>不，我才不走！我的电影还没拍完——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>只要你们处理掉那只大东西，我就可以继续拍摄……拍摄那个蠢得要死的狗屎片子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>可是……我们已经没有摄……摄——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>摄影机！笨蛋！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>你根本什么都不懂，别以为帮我做了几个道具就能对我指手画脚了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>留下对你们来说，不是一个明智的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>这里有危险，而你们不能自保。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>我们有留在这里的权利，你们不能赶我们走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你当然有留在这里的权利，金蜜儿小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>但我希望你记住，你与你的朋友正身陷危险之中，绿湖营地并不是一个适合郊游的好地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>你们应当跟在我们身边，以保证自己的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>雨越下越大了，继续待在外头会有人感冒的。让我们一起清理道路，前往避雨处吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金发姑娘沉默片刻，转头，怒气腾腾地走开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>……尽是些危言耸听的鬼话。过来，弗莱迪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>去营地里找找看，还有没有能用的斧头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>孩子们，如果发现了散落在地的牙齿，请捡起来交给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-306015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金蜜儿：</div><div>动作快点，弗莱迪！我快要冻死了！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "GLN-05"}}